This project is started on 14th oct to analyse psycometric testing for anyone

Admin and institute setup
-------------------------
Run `php artisan migrate` to create the institute and role-support tables.
Create the first administrator interactively with `php artisan app:create-admin`.
The admin signs in at `/admin/login`, creates institutes and staff accounts,
and assigns group admins to one or more institutes. Group admins sign in at
`/group-admin/login`.

Admins and group admins can import students from a CSV containing exactly
these headers: `name,email`. Each import can contain up to 500 students.
The generated temporary password is displayed once after import; share it
securely with that student batch. Imported students must set a personal
password the first time they sign in.
